{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uxeg9RmcjY6mdEsKaKcKfs","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"latest TypeScript compiler version 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"'Native' TypeScript 7 Previews in Visual Studio 2026 Insiders -- Visual Studio Magazine\",\"url\":\"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2025/10/02/native-typescript-7-previews-in-visual-studio-2026-insiders.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"typescript - npm\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7 native preview in Visual Studio 2026 - Microsoft for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developer.microsoft.com/blog/typescript-7-native-preview-in-visual-studio-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7 Beta Now Enabled by Default in Visual Studio 2026 18.6 Insiders 3 - Visual Studio Blog\",\"url\":\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/visualstudio/typescript-7-beta-now-enabled-by-default-in-visual-studio-2026-18-6-insiders-3/\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 6.0: What's New, What Breaks, and Should You Upgrade\",\"url\":\"https://codersera.com/blog/typescript-6-0-whats-new-breaking-changes-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Microsoft Releases TypeScript 7.0 with a Native Go Compiler, Delivering 10x Faster Builds - InfoQ\",\"url\":\"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/08/typescript-7-released/\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7.0 RC: The Go-Native Compiler Has Landed\",\"url\":\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/typescript-7-0-rc-go-native-compiler-2026-upgrade-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · microsoft/TypeScript\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/releases\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the latest TypeScript compiler version in 2026:\n\nThe latest version of TypeScript is 7.0.2, last published 2 months ago (as of August 2026).\n\nMicrosoft has released TypeScript 7.0, featuring a native compiler that improves build speeds by 8x to 12x. This is a major milestone because TypeScript 7.0 is the first stable version of the language to ship its long-in-development native compiler, a faithful port of the toolset from TypeScript into Go.\n\nThe development timeline leading up to this release includes:\n- TypeScript 6.0 shipped on March 23, 2026, which was the last release built on the JavaScript-based compiler\n- TypeScript 7.0 RC shipped June 18, 2026 with a Go-native compiler delivering ~10x faster type-checks\n- The project began as an experimental native port first announced in March 2025, and had been available to the community as the @typescript/native-preview package\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"521af293-48a9-4028-aa23-64f58962ffb9","uuid":"c7bc714b-4853-46a3-9285-204202ae6b90","timestamp":"2026-08-28T08:59:41.536Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"latest TypeScript compiler version 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01HsmjvHTzChdFAR2k15GoJk","content":[{"title":"'Native' TypeScript 7 Previews in Visual Studio 2026 Insiders -- Visual Studio Magazine","url":"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2025/10/02/native-typescript-7-previews-in-visual-studio-2026-insiders.aspx"},{"title":"typescript - npm","url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript"},{"title":"TypeScript 7 native preview in Visual Studio 2026 - Microsoft for Developers","url":"https://developer.microsoft.com/blog/typescript-7-native-preview-in-visual-studio-2026/"},{"title":"TypeScript 7 Beta Now Enabled by Default in Visual Studio 2026 18.6 Insiders 3 - Visual Studio Blog","url":"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/visualstudio/typescript-7-beta-now-enabled-by-default-in-visual-studio-2026-18-6-insiders-3/"},{"title":"TypeScript 6.0: What's New, What Breaks, and Should You Upgrade","url":"https://codersera.com/blog/typescript-6-0-whats-new-breaking-changes-2026/"},{"title":"Microsoft Releases TypeScript 7.0 with a Native Go Compiler, Delivering 10x Faster Builds - InfoQ","url":"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/08/typescript-7-released/"},{"title":"TypeScript 7.0 RC: The Go-Native Compiler Has Landed","url":"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/typescript-7-0-rc-go-native-compiler-2026-upgrade-guide"},{"title":"Releases · microsoft/TypeScript","url":"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/releases"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about the latest TypeScript compiler version in 2026:\n\nThe latest version of TypeScript is 7.0.2, last published 2 months ago (as of August 2026).\n\nMicrosoft has released TypeScript 7.0, featuring a native compiler that improves build speeds by 8x to 12x. This is a major milestone because TypeScript 7.0 is the first stable version of the language to ship its long-in-development native compiler, a faithful port of the toolset from TypeScript into Go.\n\nThe development timeline leading up to this release includes:\n- TypeScript 6.0 shipped on March 23, 2026, which was the last release built on the JavaScript-based compiler\n- TypeScript 7.0 RC shipped June 18, 2026 with a Go-native compiler delivering ~10x faster type-checks\n- The project began as an experimental native port first announced in March 2025, and had been available to the community as the @typescript/native-preview package"],"durationSeconds":6.303058334,"searchCount":1}}
